# Props / portfolio

## Pattern (avatar + giant + pillars)

- Load GLB → CPU skin if skinned → bind **`prop`** material (albedo) → register shadow/prepass with **static** depth shaders.
- Drive in-place clips by moving the root; sample `terrain.heightAt` / `normalAt`; damp tilt (no per-frame snap).

## Pedestals

- Data from `portfolio/projects.json` (+ sync script). Collision = XZ circle push (`COLLIDE_RADIUS`).
- Arrow footprints: `hitRadius` (detect, from min AABB half-extent) vs `surfaceRadius` (plant / embed). Do not use fat max-AABB as the plant radius.
- Approach shows **text-only** card (no thumbs); **E** opens link; **I** inspects (freezes character via `input.inspecting`).
- Key lights go through `SpellLights` — do not invent a second light pool.
- Do not reintroduce unused project GIF/thumb assets under `public/assets/portfolio/` (org logos only).

## Giant

- Patrol waypoints; proximity starts attack clips; **move-lock** while `_attacking` / `_reacting`.
- Hits require **melee contact**, not a fat remote radius:
  - Timed `HIT_DELAY` / `HIT_WINDOW` mid-swing
  - Player in front (`_facingPlayer`)
  - Hand/forearm near player **or** body-press (`HIT_CONTACT` / `HAND_HIT_R` / `BODY_PRESS`)
  - one-frame `didHit` + `giant_hit.mp3`; `main.js` calls `character.applyHit` + `avatar.playHit`
- Arrow reacts: zone clips `Hit_Back` / `Hit_Waist` / `Hit_Chest` via `playHit(zone)`; pin large root-motion hips.
- Every **5th** arrow land plays `giant_roar.mp3` (count always increments, even if react clip is busy).
- Stuck arrows attach with `attachToBone` on the nearest body bone (not the root) so they ride attacks.
- Foot stamps from stride distance matched to walk clip period; no continuous stance drag.

## Assets

- Models under `public/assets/odyssey/models/`. Crush before commit.
- Prefer albedo-only crushed GLBs; do not reintroduce multi-map PBR on props without a shader plan.
